  {
   "id": 1096271,
   "title": "How to navigate through the manual",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:04",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Use the graphical navigation buttons in the bottom right corner or the arrow keys on your keyboard:",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Play backward button / Up arrow key</strong> - Moves to the previous step.",
     "color": "blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Left arrow button / Left arrow key</strong> - Moves to the previous image, or to the previous step if it’s the first image in the step.",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Next button / Right arrow key</strong> - Moves to the next image, or to the next step if it’s the last image in the step.",
     "color": "green",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Play forward (Next) button / Down arrow</strong> <strong>key</strong> - Moves to the next step.",
     "color": "red",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Click on <strong>Contents</strong> to expand the full list of steps in this guide. This allows you to jump to any step regardless of the sequence.",
     "color": "orange",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Click on <strong>Comments</strong> to open the discussion for a specific step and leave your feedback.",
     "color": "light_blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
