  {
   "id": 1096375,
   "title": "Before you begin",
   "updated": "2026-08-12 10:27:34",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "If you plan on installing the <strong>Prusa CORE One+ Gen 2 upgrade</strong> along with the Prusa INDX conversion, follow the instructions here: <strong><a href=\"http://help.prusa3d.com/article/assemblling-the-prusa-indx-core-one-with-the-gen-2-upgrade_1147602\">Conversion of the PRUSA INDX Core One to Gen 2</a></strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The <strong>INDX Conversion kit is compatible with the Prusa CORE One and CORE One+</strong>. This guide uses the CORE One+; some disassembly steps may vary between models.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The required steps depend on your printer’s current state:",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>If your CORE One+ is brand new</strong> and still unboxed, first follow the <a href=\"http://help.prusa3d.com/guide/1-introduction_980161\"><strong>CORE One+ Unpacking &amp; First run guide</strong></a>  before installing the INDX conversion.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>If you already use the CORE One+</strong> and purchased only the INDX Conversion kit (Founders Edition) you can continue with this guide.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Do not discard any removed parts until instructed. </strong>Some parts will be reused later in the upgrade.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>This guide is for both the 4-tool and the 8-tool PRUSA Core One/+ INDX conversion kit.</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Some photos may show the 8-tool version. This does not affect the conversion process for the 4-tool version.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-800x600.jpg",
     "srcset": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-533x400.jpg 533w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-800x600.jpg 800w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-300x225.jpg 300w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-768x576.jpg 768w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/95b06d759a0434bd.jpg 1600w"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 1096424,
   "title": "All the required tools are included",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:15",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "<strong>Tools required for this upgrade:</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Use the tools originally included with your CORE One+ / CORE One printer.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Needle-nose pliers (1x)",
     "color": "red",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Philips (PH2) screwdriver (1x)",
     "color": "green",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Universal wrench (1x)",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Allen key set",
     "color": "light_blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Torx key set",
     "color": "orange",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The <strong>T10 screwdriver is included only with kit versions</strong> and may not be available with fully assembled printers. <br />It is not required, but may be more convenient in some steps.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "We also recommend printing out the community-made <strong><a href=\"https://www.printables.com/model/1208623-core-one-snap-rivet-remover\">Snap-rivet-remover</a></strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
