  {
   "id": 1096508,
   "title": "Labels guide",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:20",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "All the boxes and bags including parts for the build are labeled.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The labels include the list of contents and part count.",
     "color": "orange",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "You can download a <strong>Cheatsheet</strong> with 1:1 fastener drawings from our site <a href=\"https://prusa.io/C1-INDX-cheatsheet\">prusa.io/C1-INDX-cheatsheet</a>. Print it at 100 % on A4 paper, don't rescale it, otherwise, it won't work.",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "For PRUSA veterans: Fasteners are divided into individual bags according to its type. Not into packages for individual chapters, as it was with previous printers.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "The instructions will specify the package for each part, with the exception of fasteners, which are always located in the Fasteners package.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
