  {
   "id": 1096560,
   "title": "Spare bag",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:24",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Spare fasteners are included in each bag of fasteners. The amount of spare is always included in the total number shown on the bag.",
     "color": "green",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Similarly, some parts may include one extra piece in the same bag.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-800x600.jpg",
     "srcset": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-533x400.jpg 533w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-800x600.jpg 800w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-300x225.jpg 300w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-768x576.jpg 768w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/5ecb2d1f6f653087a3b1001159561c8d.jpg 1600w"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 1096586,
   "title": "Printed parts - versioning",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:27",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Most of the 3D printed parts are marked with their version.",
     "color": "blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>E, F and Gx series</strong> (e.g. E1) - those parts are printed on Prusa Research farm and are distributed with the kit.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>R, S and Tx series</strong> (e.g. R1) - those parts are available for download at <a href=\"https://printables.com\">https://www.printables.com/model/1758233-core-one-indx-printed-parts</a>. They are identical to the factory ones.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "The numbers indicate minor revisions that usually involve small design tweaks. A different label in the manual (e.g., a different version shown in photos) does not affect the assembly – all versions are fully compatible.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "if you have issues while assembling the printer with a specific printed part, find the label and share it with our support team.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-800x600.jpg",
     "srcset": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-533x400.jpg 533w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-800x600.jpg 800w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-300x225.jpg 300w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-768x576.jpg 768w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/7206d1dea4a483254d254bf90b1336da.jpg 1600w"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 1096636,
   "title": "We are here for you!",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:29",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Lost in the instructions, missing screw or cracked printed part? <strong>Let us know!</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "You can contact us using the following channels:",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Using comments under each step.",
     "color": "light_blue",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Using our 24/7 live chat here at <a href=\"https://help.prusa3d.com/en\">help.prusa3d.com</a>",
     "color": "violet",
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Writing an email to <a href=\"mailto:info@prusa3d.com\" subject=\"The assembly manual request\" body=\"Please write down the generation of the printer, order number and the issue you have (include pictures or video):\">info@prusa3d.com</a>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    }
   ],
