  {
   "id": 1149726,
   "title": "Optional CORE One+ Gen 2 upgrade",
   "updated": "2026-08-20 06:29:46",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "The <strong>Prusa INDX Conversion Kit for CORE One+</strong> includes parts for the optional <strong>CORE One+ Gen 2 upgrade</strong>.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>The Gen 2 upgrade is not required </strong>for the Prusa INDX upgrade.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "If you want to install the Gen 2 parts, use the companion article below. It tells you when to switch between this guide and the CORE One+ Gen 2 Upgrade guide.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong><a href=\"http://help.prusa3d.com/article/assemblling-the-prusa-indx-core-one-with-the-gen-2-upgrade_1147602\">Conversion of the PRUSA INDX Core one to Gen 2</a></strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>We recommend keeping the companion article open throughout the assembly.</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/b04592dc7b0d4c85975a86144c868557.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/b04592dc7b0d4c85975a86144c868557-800x600.jpg",
