  {
   "id": 1096874,
   "title": "Removing the MMU3",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:46",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "If your printer is equipped with the MMU3, it <strong>must be removed before continuing</strong>.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "reminder",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "This step applies to both the MMU3 <strong>Lite</strong> (left) and the MMU3 <strong>Enclosed</strong> (right).",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "note",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "html": "Turn off the printer and disconnect it from the power.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "To remove the MMU3, follow the MMU3 assembly guide in reverse order. The guide is available on the MMU3 product page <a href=\"https://prusa.io/mmu3\">prusa.io/mmu3</a>.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Once the MMU3 has been removed, return to this guide and continue with the next step.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
     "original": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50.jpg",
     "large": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-800x600.jpg",
     "srcset": "https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-533x400.jpg 533w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-800x600.jpg 800w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-300x225.jpg 300w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-768x576.jpg 768w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://help.prusa3d.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/f627ff9750bdad3744fe50f8a3c9fd50.jpg 1600w"
    }
   ]
