  {
   "id": 1096814,
   "title": "Reward yourself",
   "updated": "2026-07-14 14:10:41",
   "lines": [
    {
     "html": "Converting your CORE One+ to the INDX CORE One+ is a rewarding experience. After finishing each chapter, reward yourself. <strong>There is a bag of Haribo bears in the box just for that!</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Do not eat all the bears before you start or at once! Not following instructions will have serious consequences. We are currently assembling the Prusa Haribo tactical squad for this matter.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "After years of scientific research, we came up with a solution.  <strong>Throughout the guide, we will tell you exactly how many bears to consume.</strong>",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "Eating an incorrect amount than prescribed in the manual might lead to a sudden boost of energy. Please consult a professional in the closest candy store.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": null,
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Cut open</strong> the bag of the Prusa Haribo carefully so the gummy bears don’t spill onto the table. This step is very important!",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    },
    {
     "html": "<strong>Hide the Haribo for now!</strong> From our experience, an unattended bag with sweets might suddenly disappear. This phenomenon is confirmed by multiple cases all around the world.",
     "color": null,
     "icon": "caution",
     "level": 0
    }
   ],
   "gallery": [
    {
